    "short_description": "Create the best Contact Form for WordPress. Design, manage powerful contact pages, query tables &amp; forms effortlessly for makers &amp; businesses!",
    "description": "<h4>Contact Form Widget – Easy Contact Page, Query Table, and Form Maker</h4>\n<p><strong>Contact Form Widget</strong> is a lightweight yet powerful WordPress plugin for building professional contact forms without coding. Whether you&#8217;re a business owner, developer, or blogger, this plugin lets you build, customize, and manage contact pages easily.</p>\n<p>Unlike traditional plugins that only email queries, our plugin <strong>saves every user query in a query table</strong>. You get an admin-friendly dashboard to manage, sort, and follow up on messages.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Responsive Contact Forms</strong> – Look great on all screen sizes.</li>\n<li><strong>Query Table Management</strong> – View and manage all form submissions in the dashboard.</li>\n<li><strong>Shortcodes and Widgets</strong> – Add forms to posts, pages, or sidebars.</li>\n<li><strong>Easy Customization</strong> – Change form field labels and styles without coding.</li>\n<li><strong>SMTP Support</strong> – Send form emails securely using Gmail or custom SMTP.</li>\n<li><strong>No User Registration Needed</strong> – Quick and anonymous submissions.</li>\n<li><strong>Pre-Built Template Designs</strong> – Use one of our stylish templates or design your own.</li>\n<li><strong>Secure Form Handling</strong> – Includes anti-spam and secure submission methods.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>🎬 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FZfneLNyE4o&amp;t=43s\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">SMTP support</a></p>\n<p>🚀 <a href=\"https://awplife.com/demo/contact-form-premium/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Try Premium Demo</a><br />\n🔐 <a href=\"https://awplife.com/wordpress-plugins/contact-form-premium/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Upgrade to Premium</a></p>\n<h3>🚀 What Makes It Different?</h3>\n<p>Unlike plugins like Contact Form 7 that only email data, this plugin securely stores every form query in your WordPress database. You’ll never lose a message again — and you can view and manage entries via an intuitive Query Table system.</p>\n",
